{"unit_id":"ayuanxx-max__dsh-session-accordion#card-zh","repo":"ayuanxx-max/dsh-session-accordion","commit":"e6c990d4c457c8f6c9031d8cba3a9e2ca246f8b9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-accordion 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话轮次折叠插件，通过识别聊天流中的轮次、提问气泡和过程节点，把较早的交互收成带时间与问题摘要的一行，并默认只展开最新一轮。用户可点击折叠行展开对应轮次，再次点击提问行收起；新轮到来或切换会话时会调整展开状态。它还用 MutationObserver 和定时巡检在页面更新后重新应用显示状态，并为会话视图重建时已物化节点被撤回的情况提供兼容处理。适合希望在 Web 聊天中快速浏览会话结构、按需查看旧轮次的用户；需要 DSH Web 客户端及其聊天 DOM 结构。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:17-28","client.js:87-155","client.js:273-320","client.js:463-479","client.js:482-580"]}
{"unit_id":"ayuanxx-max__dsh-session-accordion#card-en","repo":"ayuanxx-max/dsh-session-accordion","commit":"e6c990d4c457c8f6c9031d8cba3a9e2ca246f8b9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-accordion folds earlier DSH Web chat turns into timestamped question summaries and keeps the newest turn open. Users can click rows to expand older turns; DOM updates trigger a refresh. It requires the DSH Web chat interface.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:17-28","client.js:87-155","client.js:273-320","client.js:463-479","client.js:482-580"]}
