{"unit_id":"ayuanxx-max__dsh-session-accordion#feature-time-summary","repo":"ayuanxx-max/dsh-session-accordion","commit":"e6c990d4c457c8f6c9031d8cba3a9e2ca246f8b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-accordion 的功能「时间与提问摘要」：把折叠轮次显示为单行，提供时间标签和提问摘要；摘要会去掉操作栏文字并截短过长内容。时间优先读取节点数据，也可回退到页面时钟文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:162-170"]}
{"unit_id":"ayuanxx-max__dsh-session-accordion#feature-latest-turn","repo":"ayuanxx-max/dsh-session-accordion","commit":"e6c990d4c457c8f6c9031d8cba3a9e2ca246f8b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-accordion 的功能「最新轮次默认展开」：打开会话或出现新轮次时自动展开最新交互，并将旧轮次折叠；用户可点击提问行切换该轮的展开状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:327-387"]}
{"unit_id":"ayuanxx-max__dsh-session-accordion#feature-mutation-refresh","repo":"ayuanxx-max/dsh-session-accordion","commit":"e6c990d4c457c8f6c9031d8cba3a9e2ca246f8b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-accordion 的功能「页面更新后恢复折叠」：监听聊天 DOM 变化并安排下一帧重新应用轮次显示状态，同时每隔一段时间巡检，覆盖 React 重绘后的节点。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:432-479"]}
{"unit_id":"ayuanxx-max__dsh-session-accordion#feature-withdraw-guard","repo":"ayuanxx-max/dsh-session-accordion","commit":"e6c990d4c457c8f6c9031d8cba3a9e2ca246f8b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-accordion 的功能「聊天节点撤回兼容」：为 system-message 与 request-prompt 定义包装视图节点构建函数；原构建返回空值但已有 chat 节点时，保留同 key 节点并标记隐藏。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:482-580"]}
{"unit_id":"ayuanxx-max__dsh-session-accordion#caveat-dom-contract","repo":"ayuanxx-max/dsh-session-accordion","commit":"e6c990d4c457c8f6c9031d8cba3a9e2ca246f8b9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-accordion 依赖聊天面板中的 data-slot、data-chat-turn 等内部 DOM 标记来识别轮次；如果 DSH 上游调整这些结构，折叠功能可能无法识别并停止应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:20-28"]}
